# ── Sensitive/local documentation ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Markdown is tracked by default. Keep only documents known to contain local
# credentials, internal host details, security findings, or live UAT notes out
# of the hosted repository. Scrub and review a file before removing it here.
PROJECT_STATUS.md
docs/security/
docs/uat/*.md
docs/operations/grafana-wazuh-wall.md
docs/architecture/reporting-layer-build.md
docs/architecture/reporting-layer-design.md

# A blanket *.js rule used to hide application JavaScript silently. JavaScript
# is now tracked by default so Phase 4 can move inline behavior into static/js/.
